<title>GERMANY: German Aug wholesale prices down 0.6 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>German Aug wholesale prices down 0.6 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE PRICES	Aug 96     July 96	 Aug 95</p>
<p> Monthly change		    -0.6	  -0.5	   -0.6</p>
<p> Yearly change		     -0.5	  -0.5	   +0.6</p>
<p> Index (basis 1991)	     102.9	 103.5	  103.4</p>
<p>Prices for the following items rose from previous month:</p>
<p> Cold pork					 +3.0 pct</p>
<p> Livestock for slaughter		     +2.8 pct</p>
<p> Heating oil				     +1.7 pct</p>
<p>The following items fell from the previous month:</p>
<p> Sea fish					 -29.0 pct</p>
<p> Fresh vegetables			     -16.0 pct</p>
<p> Fresh fruit				     -8.6 pct</p>
<p> Scrap steel				     -6.1 pct</p>
<p> Grain					     -5.9 pct</p>
<p> Fish meal and mixed fodder		  -2.1 pct</p>
</text>
